城市街景轮廓。光线依旧以自然光源为主，但在门框处透进一丝冷色光，暗示室外可能已临近傍晚。色调渐变为偏冷的灰调，强化离别的情绪。最终定格在人物背影与空旷房间的对比，镜头停止运动，情绪收束于宁静的结束感。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 49, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 41, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 31}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [1], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [355.8971862792969, 110.67224884033203], "pos": [136.22586059570312, 280.1893310546875], "widgets_values": ["wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp16.safetensors", "fp8_e4m3fn"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [245], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [788.405517578125, 74.84220886230469], "widgets_values": ["auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 4, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "sage_attention"}, "name": "sage_attention", "label": "sage_attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "sage_attention"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "PathchSageAttentionKJ", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PathchSageAttentionKJ"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [44], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["fisrt frame"], "inputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "link": 32, "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SetNode", "title": "Set_fisrt frame", "mode": 0,